---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Alex Morgan | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <header id="hero" class="section hero-section"
        style="background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;">
        <div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
             <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 3rem; line-height: 1.2; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">
                About MPDC
            </h1>
             <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
                Rebuilding lives through structure, clarity, and action.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- STORY CONTENT BLOCK (White Background) -->
    <section class="content-block" style="background-color: var(--color-text-light); padding: 4rem 2rem;">
        <style>
            @media (max-width: 768px) {
                .content-block {
                    padding: 3rem 1.5rem !important;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                I’m Alex Morgan, a divorce recovery coach who helps men navigate one of the most challenging transitions
                of their lives with
                clarity, structure, and purpose.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                Like many men, my own divorce required me to re examine my identity, priorities, and direction. It was a
                difficult period that
                demanded honest self reflection and intentional rebuilding. Through that process, I learned that simply
                moving on is not enough.
                Lasting progress comes from understanding what changed, what was lost, and how to rebuild from a
                stronger foundation.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                That experience led me to focus on helping other men do the same. My work centers on guiding men through
                practical recovery by
                regaining confidence, re establishing personal standards, and creating stability after divorce.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                This work is not about revisiting the past or assigning blame. It is about growth, responsibility, and
                building a future that feels
                solid, intentional, and aligned with who you want to become.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEADERSHIP SECTION -->

</Layout>
